      "notes": "Nemotron 3.5 Lightning 30B-A3B (hybrid Mamba2-Transformer MoE, 128 experts/7 active). Q4_0 quantization (17.44 GiB, requantized from Q4_K_M). Decode with native MTP speculative decoding (draft-mtp, n-max=4, 95-99% acceptance, n=5 median). No-spec decode: 68.0 t/s. Q4_0 delivers +78% over Q4_K_M (38->68 t/s no-spec) due to simpler GEMV dequantization. Measured power: 134.0W avg (cap 230W). GPU temp: ~64C. Custom kernel fusion: ssm_conv bias+SiLU, ssm_scan dt_bias+D*x, MMQ/XMX dispatch override. Build: llama.cpp SYCL f785fc9ea. KV: q8_0/q4_1, FA on.",
